(6956819, 1048279, 97225, '<td valign="top">An image of a simple and mundane thing - and it transported me back through half a century to my Grandfather, sitting on his back porch, swatting flies in the summer heat. Thank you for the memory.</td>', 'An image of a simple and mundane thing - and it transported me back through half a century to my Grandfather, sitting on his back porch, swatting flies in the summer heat. Thank you for the memory.', '2013-01-14 00:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
