(6957163, 1049236, 112539, '<td valign="top">Women looked too posed. Didn''t look like she was really dreaming...just that her eyes were closed.</td>', 'Women looked too posed. Didn''t look like she was really dreaming...just that her eyes were closed.', '2013-01-14 11:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957196, 1048676, 10785, '<td valign="top">Yay!!!! Too cool!!!! You are the best! I cant believe you remembered. My daughter said "hey, that''s my name!! And she''s dressed like a ballerina." Thanks so much. She got a big kick out of this shot and it is so well executed. Now you gotta get that children''s book made.</td>', 'Yay!!!! Too cool!!!! You are the best! I cant believe you remembered. My daughter said "hey, that''s my name!! And she''s dressed like a ballerina." Thanks so much. She got a big kick out of this shot and it is so well executed. Now you gotta get that children''s book made.', '2013-01-14 12:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957200, 1049283, 118154, '<td valign="top">Good shot,works for me.</td>', 'Good shot,works for me.', '2013-01-14 12:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957204, 1049046, 118154, '<td valign="top">Love the tone,good intense moment.</td>', 'Love the tone,good intense moment.', '2013-01-14 12:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957207, 1049236, 10785, '<td valign="top">I gave this an abovfe average vote for the quality of the photo. However as a representation of the art of dance, I feel it is lacking. I don''t feel you have captured the lines and shapes of a dancer''s form, though the emotion is clearly there.</td>', 'I gave this an abovfe average vote for the quality of the photo. However as a representation of the art of dance, I feel it is lacking. I don''t feel you have captured the lines and shapes of a dancer''s form, though the emotion is clearly there.', '2013-01-14 12:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
