(6957418, 1049069, 68947, '<td valign="top">I like this and yet I am just "ok" about it.  Not sure whether to focus on the scupture portion or the trees.  I was trying to figure out what might have made this more interesting and/or more focused on the sculpture portion and all that I could come up with was...a different angle to this shot.  Love the brightness/crispness to the trees. :)  (Commenting only)</td>', 'I like this and yet I am just "ok" about it.  Not sure whether to focus on the scupture portion or the trees.  I was trying to figure out what might have made this more interesting and/or more focused on the sculpture portion and all that I could come up with was...a different angle to this shot.  Love the brightness/crispness to the trees. :)  (Commenting only)', '2013-01-14 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957419, 1049068, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely angles.  The contrast of the horizontal water ripple lines against the vertical lines of the birds wings are very striking...especially, with the slight ripple/choppy texture in the lower right hand corner.  Works very well.</td>', 'Lovely angles.  The contrast of the horizontal water ripple lines against the vertical lines of the birds wings are very striking...especially, with the slight ripple/choppy texture in the lower right hand corner.  Works very well.', '2013-01-14 19:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6957421, 1049133, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely shadows and highlights with very nice angles to the bird feeder (I''m assuming that''s what it is).  The textures of the feeder to the snow is really pleasing.</td>', 'Lovely shadows and highlights with very nice angles to the bird feeder (I''m assuming that''s what it is).  The textures of the feeder to the snow is really pleasing.', '2013-01-14 19:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
