(6960708, 1049222, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great capture (voted earlier).</td>', 'Great capture (voted earlier).', '2013-01-18 19:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6960734, 1049286, 157380, '<td valign="top">I find the finish of this image instintly appealing then a little bit of a let down on closer examination. It makes me go ooooo painterly finish effect and look closer which is great but then it looks like maybe it doesn''t have that little something else to keep me keen. I''d love to talk to you about how you did this and see if we can exchange some ideas with the direction this is headed. I voted it up for instant apeal but down for subject and depth. (also nicely lit and composed).</td>', 'I find the finish of this image instintly appealing then a little bit of a let down on closer examination. It makes me go ooooo painterly finish effect and look closer which is great but then it looks like maybe it doesn''t have that little something else to keep me keen. I''d love to talk to you about how you did this and see if we can exchange some ideas with the direction this is headed. I voted it up for instant apeal but down for subject and depth. (also nicely lit and composed).', '2013-01-18 20:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6960735, 1048895, 157380, '<td valign="top">nice find. I feel your subject is well lit and the depth of field is nice. for me the bold black frame and vibrant colours in the background are stealing the shot. Daniel is a passive subject in the image as a result. I like the composition and it looks like you had the time of day right for lighting.</td>', 'nice find. I feel your subject is well lit and the depth of field is nice. for me the bold black frame and vibrant colours in the background are stealing the shot. Daniel is a passive subject in the image as a result. I like the composition and it looks like you had the time of day right for lighting.', '2013-01-18 20:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6960737, 1049230, 157380, '<td valign="top">awesome abstract subject, but the compostition gives away too much of the story. If I were to describe this it would be as a shelter with some art on it. Another framing could result in a description of abstract art on a shelter. I''d have scored this higher if the framing alowed it to be enjoyed as a sureal experience.</td>', 'awesome abstract subject, but the compostition gives away too much of the story. If I were to describe this it would be as a shelter with some art on it. Another framing could result in a description of abstract art on a shelter. I''d have scored this higher if the framing alowed it to be enjoyed as a sureal experience.', '2013-01-18 20:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6960738, 1049220, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, nice depth of field. The colouring in this image is not working for me, it''s a bit busy and the sky could be greyed up for a more moody effect. Those purple chairs are hidious. Love the way you got inside and outside lit in the same capture, nice job with that</td>', 'Nice framing, nice depth of field. The colouring in this image is not working for me, it''s a bit busy and the sky could be greyed up for a more moody effect. Those purple chairs are hidious. Love the way you got inside and outside lit in the same capture, nice job with that', '2013-01-18 20:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6960739, 1049199, 157380, '<td valign="top">This is cute. <br/>I think the point of focus should either be the childs eyes or the brush, the shirt seams like autofocus stole a good image from you. <br/>Loving the chaos of the colours, art uninhibited.</td>', 'This is cute. I think the point of focus should either be the childs eyes or the brush, the shirt seams like autofocus stole a good image from you. Loving the chaos of the colours, art uninhibited.', '2013-01-18 20:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
