(6995918, 1049030, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is my opinion only--the light serves to define the object clearly--and that'' all that is happening in this comp.  To get a high score from me, the light must interact with the subject, for example, to help me imagine the legs, or to make it irrelevant that it has no legs. A photo of <i>un objet d''art</i> does not necessarily create an art photo.<br/> <br/>The interaction of the light with the subject is something I''m trying to learn myself, so I am looking for it in every photo I see. Here is some light interacting with a horse, at least to my eye.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=934719" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1331/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_934719.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1331/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_934719.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1331/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_934719.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is my opinion only--the light serves to define the object clearly--and that'' all that is happening in this comp.  To get a high score from me, the light must interact with the subject, for example, to help me imagine the legs, or to make it irrelevant that it has no legs. A photo of un objet d''art does not necessarily create an art photo. The interaction of the light with the subject is something I''m trying to learn myself, so I am looking for it in every photo I see. Here is some light interacting with a horse, at least to my eye.', '2013-03-09 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
